                <head>No. 119.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lowell to Mr. Frelinghuysen</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 2,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Lowell reports that the majority of the Americans have already been
                    released. The secretary for Ireland thinks that only three remain.]</p>
            </div>
